    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="51">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 51</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XCV} Gif gesiðcund mon landagende forsitte fierd, geselle CXX sciƚƚ ⁊ ðolie his landes; unlandagende LX sciƚƚ; cierlisc XXX sciƚƚ to fierdwite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a nobly born man who owns property neglects [his duty to serve] in the army, let him pay 120 shillings and forfeit his land; [a noble] who does not own property, 60 shillings; a man of ceorl-wer, 30 shillings as fyrd-fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a nobleman who holds land neglects military service, he shall pay 120 shillings and forfeit his land; a nobleman who holds no land shall pay 60 shillings ; a commoner shall pay a fine of 30 shillings for neglecting military service.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif gesiðcund mon londagende fyrd forsitte, gesylle CXX scll' ⁊ þolie his londes; londagende LX scillinga; ceorlisc XXX to fyrdwite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
